            "description": {
              "value": "You're surrounded by a palpable sense of menace and power that's terrifying to behold. The aura is a 15-foot emanation. An enemy that enters or ends its turn in the aura must attempt a Will save against the higher of your spell DC or class DC.\n\nSuccess: The creature is unaffected and temporarily immune to your Frightful Aura for 1 minute.\nFailure: The creature is frightened 1.\nCritical Failure: The creature is frightened 2."
